D.102.0100. - The system shall support the ability to send emails when a record is saved on a specific form/survey
D.102.0200. - The system shall support the ability to send emails when a record is saved on a specific form/survey with Complete Status Only
D.102.0300. - The system shall support the ability to send emails If conditional logic is TRUE when a record is saved on a specific form/survey
D.102.0400. - The system shall support the ability to send emails When conditional logic is TRUE during a data import, data entry, or as the result of time-based logic
D.102.0500. - The system shall support the ability to copy, deactivate, reactivate, move and permanently delete alerts and notifications
D.102.0600. - The system shall support the ability to upload/download the settings of alerts and notifications